# thinking — a principled means refuses a crime while it is thought out, not after the click
#
# Ripelore chooses to steal from the chest and Discipline, a high-morality action modus mentis, is
# pinned as the means. HighMoralityRefusesCrimeRule refuses it during the think, unasked: the
# refusal is narrated and no button is produced — the act is never offered, so no point can be
# spent attempting it. The refusal reaches the proposal ledger like any other: Learned Research,
# a different mind, is still offered stealing, and since it was refused once already this phase the
# means is narrowed to those the willingness rules let through. `means none` hands the draw back to
# the RNG, so the button can only appear if that narrowing kept Discipline out.
#
# Buttons are asserted as "] <goal>" — the tail of "[Knack ●] steal …" — which the prose never
# contains. Ripelore is chosen by id: the popup is sorted by name, so its first entry is not it.
#
# --doubt low: one try, no iterative thinking — a retry would step around the refusal
# this script is about (see thinking_iterates.cli and thinking_click_rules_not_retried.cli for the retries).
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Room" --period night --observe-only "Test Chest" --grant-mm discipline,knack,scientific_research --means-only discipline --doubt low

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal steal
advance 12 180

# By night: awake in her own room the weaver would confront whoever walked in, and nothing but
# her could then be looked at.
# Ripelore; Discipline refuses to steal, before any act exists.
click observe "Test Chest"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Chest"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
expect-state texts "against every principle I hold"
expect-no-state trees verb=steal

# Learned Research: still offered stealing, carried out by a means that would not refuse. At seed 42
# the draw lands on Stealth, a discreet means, whose button reads "[Stealth ⟐] discreetly steal …".
means none
click think "Test Chest"
choose scientific_research
advance 12 180
expect-state trees verb=steal
expect-state trees discreetly steal

quit
